     cam(4), firewire(4), targ(4), camcontrol(8), fwcontrol(8), kldload(8),
     scsi_target(8)

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     The ssbbpp__ttaarrgg driver was written by Hidetoshi Shimokawa.

BBUUGGSS
